# 🚀 DataNova Analytics — Universal Analytics & Predictive Intelligence Platform

**Transform Raw Data into Smart Insights and Predictions.**

DataNova Analytics is an interactive data analytics and machine learning platform built using **Python, Streamlit, Pandas, Plotly, and Scikit-learn**. It helps users explore datasets, analyze trends, visualize patterns, identify data quality issues, and generate predictions through an interactive dashboard.

## 📌 Project Overview

DataNova Analytics brings data exploration, visualization, data quality analysis, and predictive modeling together in one platform. Users can upload their own datasets, apply filters, analyze key metrics, explore interactive charts, and experiment with machine learning models.

